% ============================================================================
% Your publications go here. Entries are grouped and sorted by `year`
% automatically (see the `scholar:` block in _config.yml).
%
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
% WARNING, read this before editing:
% In BibTeX, "%" is NOT a comment character (that is a LaTeX convention).
% Anything following an "at" sign is parsed as an entry no matter how many
% "%" you put in front of it, and one malformed entry fails the whole site
% build. So never leave a half-written or "commented-out" entry in this file --
% draft it in FILL-IN.md and paste it here only when it is complete.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
%
% al-folio-specific fields (authoritative list: `filtered_bibtex_keywords`
% in _config.yml):
%
%   abbr         the coloured badge on the left (ICRA, RSS, T-RO, ...)
%   selected     true -> also listed under "selected publications" on the homepage
%   preview      image or gif in assets/img/publication_preview/
%   pdf          a full URL, or a filename placed in assets/pdf/
%   code website video poster slides supp html blog     extra buttons
%   abstract     renders an expandable Abstract button
%   award        a highlighted award line under the entry
%   bibtex_show  true adds a "Bib" button showing the raw entry
%   arxiv altmetric dimensions inspirehep_id google_scholar_id   citation badges
%
% A complete worked example of every field is in papers.bib.example.
% ============================================================================
